@page "/organization"
@layout PublicLayout

<PageTitle>Organization - C.R.E.D.O.</PageTitle>

<div class="public-page">
    <section class="public-section">
        <div class="public-section__grid">
            <div>
                <h1 class="public-section__title">Organization</h1>

                <div class="public-section__text">
                    <p>
                        C.R.E.D.O. is a Star Citizen organization built around
                        community, respect, excellence, dedication and order.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        This is where our identity and structure come together:
                        who we are, how we operate, and what kind of member
                        experience we want to create.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        We value coordinated play, reliable teamwork and a clear
                        sense of belonging without losing sight of the people
                        behind every pilot, specialist and crew member.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="public-section__image" aria-label="C.R.E.D.O. organization image"></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="public-section">
        <div class="public-values">
            <article class="public-value-card">
                <div class="public-value-card__icon">●</div>
                <h3>Identity</h3>
                <p>
                    A disciplined community with a shared standard for respect,
                    reliability and long-term growth.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="public-value-card">
                <div class="public-value-card__icon">⌖</div>
                <h3>Structure</h3>
                <p>
                    Clear roles, coordinated divisions and operational focus give
                    members a path to contribute with purpose.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="public-value-card">
                <div class="public-value-card__icon">★</div>
                <h3>Standards</h3>
                <p>
                    We prepare, communicate and improve together so that every
                    mission benefits from trust and discipline.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="public-section">
        <div class="public-section__grid">
            <div>
                <h2 class="public-section__title">Joining C.R.E.D.O.</h2>

                <div class="public-section__text">
                    <p>
                        If the organization feels like the right fit, the next
                        step is the Join Us page. For direct questions,
                        diplomacy or external requests, use Contact.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="public-section__text">
                <div class="public-hero__actions">
                    <a class="credo-button credo-button-primary" href="/join-us">
                        Join Us
                        <span>›</span>
                    </a>

                    <a class="credo-button credo-button-ghost" href="/contact">
                        Contact
                        <span>›</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
